  "releaseNotes": "# Adjustments\n      - Enabled retrieval of field data linked to other databases.\n      - Improved batch retrieval of detail data.\n      - Adjusted padding.\n      - Refined error display for validation.\n      - Changed server error messages to be determined by the browser's language settings instead of the server's language settings.\n\n      # New Features\n      - Added the ability to configure fonts for headers and sidebars.\n      - Introduced a mode where the list editing control is displayed by default.\n      - Enabled specification of horizontal alignment in lists.",
